  "bodyHash": "f496b87e9daa00be",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">是否曾想過融入當地居民之中？透過 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">村莊假面舞會</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，你可以穿著與村民相同的服裝在他們中間閒逛。從農民沾滿灰塵的帽子到圖書管理員優雅的長袍，每個職業都有獨特的風格。這些服裝或許無法抵擋箭矢，但能贏得好感並在交易時獲得更優惠的價格。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">每件裝備在與對應職業的村民交易時都能提供小幅折扣，穿戴的件數越多，效果就越強。大多數套裝可透過與大師級村民交易取得。有些套裝較難尋獲，由災厄村民或鐵傀儡掉落，而另一些則隱藏在村莊寶箱中。無論你是為了收藏、角色扮演，還是單純想討好你喜愛的圖書管理員，這款模組都能讓每次進城變得更加有趣。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">村民服飾：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿著靈感源自各職業村民的服裝。每件裝備在與對應村民交易時皆可提供折扣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鎧甲匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">戴上護目鏡與圍裙，展現專業金屬工藝師風範。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🥩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">屠夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">繫上堅固的頭帶與圍裙，準備進行肉類交易。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🗺️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">製圖師：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">佩戴閃亮單片眼鏡與皮革束帶，展現俐落造型。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✝️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">神職人員：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿上高領與精緻長袍，適合進行神聖調藥。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌾 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">農民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">戴上寬邊帽遮陽，並用腰帶隨身攜帶工具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎣 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">漁夫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">戴上帽子、背心與護腿，隨時準備前往碼頭工作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">箭匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">配戴羽毛帽與輕便腰帶，與箭矢完美搭配。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👞 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">皮革匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿上粗獷圍裙，進行皮革鞣製與加工。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">圖書管理員：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">披上柔軟長袍與整齊的頭飾，專心靜讀。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">石匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿上沾有石粉的圍裙，保持整潔利落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">白癡村民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">穿上長袍與護腿，展現慵懶迷人的氣息。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐑 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">牧羊人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">戴上羊毛帽與背心，保暖舒適。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚒️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">工具匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">套上工作圍裙，隨時準備投入鍛造工作。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">武器匠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">戴上眼罩與圍裙，展現嚴肅專業的態度。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕰️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">經典村民：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在村莊戰利品寶箱中尋找舊版長袍與護腿。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">流浪商人：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過交易取得鮮豔的兜帽、長袍與護腿。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">災厄村民套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">由劫掠者、伏擊者、喚魔師與女巫掉落。全套穿戴即可偽裝成他們。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">女巫套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">提供保護，免受有害藥水效果影響。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鐵傀儡套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">稀有掉落物，賦予抗擊退能力與力量加成。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎅 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">秘密聖誕老人套裝：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">為節慶季節增添歡樂氣氛的趣味服裝。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝於客戶端與伺服器</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需先安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需先安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需先安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援設定，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行調整（Fabric 版需先安裝 Prospector 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，也需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名依設定類型分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有模組都會包含全部類型，甚至可能完全沒有設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/enderpreston/projects\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">EnderPreston</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 原創的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-employment\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Village Employment</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，其素材已重新整理並融入本模組，為現代 Minecraft 帶來嶄新體驗。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/hopper-gadgetry\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hoppergadgetry/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/natural-waters\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/naturalwaters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fantastic-wings\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fantasticwings/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/villagemasquerade/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
